// ====== The beginner-to-method worlds added in v3 ======
//
// The original ten arcs assumed a player who already knew what a point, a
// session or a hammer candle was. These six fill the gaps, written for futures
// (NQ and GC — never shares) and around the way the B.R.E.A.D method is actually
// traded: levels first, a reaction candle second, the body close decides.
//
// Every line carries two voices: `t` for the kid profile, `a` for the adult one.
// Same idea, same order — only the wording changes (see engine/voice.js).
//
// Session times are US Eastern and approximate on purpose: they drift by an hour
// around the daylight-saving changes, and the lesson is the rhythm, not the minute.

